                <cl:output std:sid="output-31203bbb" value="Pasig River Bank, Inc. (PRB) is a publicly listed issuer on the Philippine Stock Exchange under the Financials sector, Banks subsector.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;The company was admitted to listing on Jan 24, 1990 and continues to disclose material information through the exchange's official channels in accordance with applicable listing and disclosure rules.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Its principal activities focus on delivering products and services aligned with its registered industry classification, serving institutional and retail stakeholders across Metro Manila and key regional markets in Luzon, Visayas, and Mindanao.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Management maintains governance practices that emphasize board oversight, timely financial reporting, and transparent communication with shareholders, regulators, and the investing public.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Strategic priorities include operational resilience, prudent capital allocation, and sustained compliance with corporate governance and sustainability-related disclosure expectations.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Over recent reporting periods, the issuer has highlighted initiatives to strengthen internal controls, modernize customer-facing platforms, and deepen engagement with host communities where it operates.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Investor materials typically cover financial performance summaries, material transactions, dividend policies when declared, and updates on projects or franchises material to the franchise or license portfolio.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;The company coordinates with its external auditor and transfer agent to support accurate share registry records and the orderly conduct of stockholders' meetings as provided in its by-laws.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Public disclosures are intended for general information only and do not constitute an offer to sell or a solicitation to buy any securities of the company.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;For the most current filings, please refer to subsequent company announcements and periodic reports published through the PSE EDGE Portal.">
                  <cl:verticaldata std:sid="v-data-1af08919" width="100px" height="266px" autosize="height"/>
                </cl:output>
                <cl:verticallayout std:sid="v-layout-682a33ab" spacing="24"/>
              </cl:group>
